Title: A Small Light
Credit: A play by
Author: Jules Poster

>CHARACTERS<

ANA - The library caretaker.

SAM - A neighbour with a spare key.

>SETTING<

A closed library.

>TIME<

After sunset.

>ACT I<

.SCENE 1

A light glows in the window.

@ANA
(quietly)
I found the key.

@SAM
Then who locked the door?

.SCENE 2

A door closes.

@ANA
We can leave now.

>END OF ACT I<
